<div
  class="modal fade"
  id="why-not-js-org-Modal"
  tabindex="-1"
  role="dialog"
  aria-labelledby="why-not-js-org-ModalLabel"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="close"
          data-dismiss="modal"
          aria-hidden="true">&times;</button
        >
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="why-not-js-org-ModalLabel">
          Why not js.org?
        </h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>
          Thanks to the JS.ORG maintainers, I've learned that my project is not
          related to JavaScript itself as my project's core purpose.
        </p>
        <p>
          Conversely, natsume.mcenahle.is-a.dev and natsume.is-cool.dev are
          awaiting their respective approvals.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal"
          >关闭</button
        >
      </div>
    </div><!-- /.modal-content -->
  </div><!-- /.modal -->
</div>
